			<tr>
<th id="2">第２巻 東京国立博物館 遮光器土偶</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/worldmuseum013.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/worldmuseum013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/sekainohakubutsukan/img/worldmuseum013.jpg" --></a><a href="img/worldmuseum014.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/worldmuseum014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_syokugann/sekainohakubutsukan/img/worldmuseum014.jpg" --></a></td>
